From 0288b39ff61740ff517b0f18026564dd608ac15d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Luis=20Qui=C3=B1ones?= <lpaandres2020@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 12:13:02 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Open an image in a viewer pane from its tile or its tag in
 the transcript

A tile's #N label and each [Image #N] tag in a sent message are now buttons
that open the image full size in a docked pane, its aspect ratio kept. The
engine's message row is opaque to a hook, so a row holding tags is drawn by
the mod, wrapped word by word; a collapsed row keeps the engine's drawing
with the tags as buttons under it.

Esc, pressing the same tag again, or the pane losing the keyboard it held
closes the viewer. With text in the composer the pane can't take the
keyboard, so the toggle is the way out there.
